#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:107
msgid "Update the Klaude Monitor service"
msgstr "Actualizar el servicio de Klaude Monitor"

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:107
msgid "Set up the Klaude Monitor service"
msgstr "Configurar el servicio de Klaude Monitor"

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:112
msgid ""
"This widget includes version %1 of the background service, but version %2 is "
"running. Updating replaces the service files and restarts it. Your history "
"and settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"Este widget incluye la versión %1 del servicio en segundo plano, pero se "
"está ejecutando la versión %2. Al actualizar se sustituyen los archivos del "
"servicio y se reinicia. Tu historial y tus ajustes se conservan."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:112
msgid ""
"Klaude Monitor gets its data from a small background service that watches "
"the Claude Code sessions on this computer. Both Klaude Monitor widgets share "
"it. It is not installed yet."
msgstr ""
"Klaude Monitor obtiene sus datos de un pequeño servicio en segundo plano que "
"vigila las sesiones de Claude Code de este equipo. Los dos widgets de Klaude "
"Monitor lo comparten. Todavía no está instalado."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:119
msgid "What this will do:"
msgstr "Esto es lo que se hará:"

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:124
msgid ""
"Copy the service to <tt>~/.local/lib/klaude-monitor</tt> and the commands "
"<tt>klaude-monitor</tt>, <tt>klaude-monitord</tt> and <tt>klaude-monitor-"
"hook</tt> to <tt>~/.local/bin</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Copiar el servicio en <tt>~/.local/lib/klaude-monitor</tt> y los comandos "
"<tt>klaude-monitor</tt>, <tt>klaude-monitord</tt> y <tt>klaude-monitor-hook</"
"tt> en <tt>~/.local/bin</tt>."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:125
msgid ""
"Register it as a user service that starts when you log in (systemd), and on "
"D-Bus so the widgets can reach it."
msgstr ""
"Registrarlo como servicio de usuario que se inicia al iniciar sesión "
"(systemd), y en D-Bus para que los widgets puedan comunicarse con él."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:126
msgid "Start it now."
msgstr "Iniciarlo ahora."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:127
msgid ""
"Everything stays in your home folder: no administrator password is needed "
"and nothing is sent over the network."
msgstr ""
"Todo queda en tu carpeta personal: no hace falta contraseña de administrador "
"y no se envía nada por la red."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:152
msgid "Also add the Claude Code hooks (recommended)"
msgstr "Añadir también los hooks de Claude Code (recomendado)"

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:162
msgid ""
"Adds entries to <tt>~/.claude/settings.json</tt> (and to other Claude config "
"folders in use) so Claude Code reports the exact question, permission or "
"error a session is waiting on. The file is backed up first as "
"<tt>settings.json.klaude-monitor.bak</tt>. Undo with <tt>klaude-monitor "
"hooks uninstall</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Añade entradas a <tt>~/.claude/settings.json</tt> (y a otras carpetas de "
"configuración de Claude en uso) para que Claude Code informe de la pregunta, "
"el permiso o el error exacto que espera cada sesión. Antes se guarda una "
"copia como <tt>settings.json.klaude-monitor.bak</tt>. Se deshace con "
"<tt>klaude-monitor hooks uninstall</tt>."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:172
msgid "Update service"
msgstr "Actualizar servicio"

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:172
msgid "Install service"
msgstr "Instalar servicio"

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:184
msgid "Installing…"
msgstr "Instalando…"

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:193
msgid "The installation failed. Details below."
msgstr "La instalación falló. Detalles a continuación."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:193
msgid ""
"Service installed and running. It may take a few seconds to show your "
"sessions."
msgstr ""
"Servicio instalado y en marcha. Puede tardar unos segundos en mostrar tus "
"sesiones."

#: shared/qml/ServiceSetup.qml:213
msgid ""
"Requires Python 3 with PyGObject, preinstalled on most KDE systems. To "
"remove the service later, run <tt>klaude-monitor uninstall</tt>."
msgstr ""
"Requiere Python 3 con PyGObject, preinstalado en la mayoría de sistemas KDE. "
"Para quitar el servicio más adelante, ejecuta <tt>klaude-monitor uninstall</"
"tt>."

